# Check out text with LF everywhere. The dictionaries (dict.txt, mozc-dict.txt,
# fixtures) are parsed byte-by-byte, and a CRLF checkout on Windows (autocrlf)
# would otherwise leave "\r" in every last field (ADR-035, GyaimCore on Windows).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.gguf binary
*.graffle binary
*.zip binary
